  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hey! The problem's in the title. What PC players see Quest users doing with fingertracking isn't what they're actually doing. You can see the splay, but the fingers only bend with the range of motion that index has. This makes using it for signed languages so much harder to communicate that it's not worth using hand tracking at all.",
